%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: Owned one-page ESC/P offline filter fixture
%%Creator: epson-printer-app offline contract
%%Pages: 1
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 792
%%EndComments
%%Page: 1 1
<< /PageSize [612 792] >> setpagedevice
/Helvetica findfont 14 scalefont setfont
72 720 moveto (Offline ESC/P filter check - file output only.) show
newpath 72 690 moveto 250 690 lineto 250 640 lineto 72 640 lineto closepath stroke
showpage
%%EOF
